What balance is visible through first after alias.deposit(50)?

```java
class Wallet {
  private int balance;
  void deposit(int amount) {
    if (amount <= 0) throw new IllegalArgumentException("Positive amount required");
    balance = Math.addExact(balance, amount);
  }
  int balance() { return balance; }
}
Wallet first = new Wallet();
Wallet alias = first;
alias.deposit(50);
System.out.println(first.balance());
```
